# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS AND SESSION MATERIAL — never commit these.
#
# A Telegram .session file contains an authenticated session key. Anyone with it
# can read and send as the account, without the phone, the password, or 2FA.
# Treat it exactly like a private key.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.session
*.session-journal
*.session-shm
*.session-wal
sessions/
**/sessions/
*.session_string

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json

# Permission policy may name real chats and people; the example is safe.
policy.yaml
policy.yml
!policy.example.yaml

